# Response headers for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages (GitHub Pages ignores
# this file; see docs/INSTALLATION.md). BrowserOS is a static site with no
# server code, so these are the only server-side settings it has.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy is set on purpose: Code Studio runs the
# user's own pages in sandboxed srcdoc frames, and those frames inherit
# the parent page's policy, so a strict policy would break the preview of
# ordinary HTML with inline scripts. See docs/SECURITY.md.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=()

# Font files never change under the same name.
/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000
